  "ruleText": "Csp 201.01 Practices of the Commission Generally. The commission’s general practices and proceedings shall take place in accordance with Csp 202, relating to proceedings of the commission, and Csp 203, relating to rulemaking petitions.\n\nSource. #7083, eff 8-26-99, EXPIRED: 8-26-07\n\nNew. #9584, eff 11-2-09",
